comments:
@aghamir The basefee will change all the time.

Before 1559, the gasprice limit is applied to the tip(legacy gasprice) which is straightforward. But after 1559, the semantic of `--gpo.maxprice` **shouldn't** change, it should still applied to the maximum value users want to pay. But right now it's only applied to tip, basefee is ignored.

I will send a PR to fix it very soon, thanks for the report and sorry for your loss.
